[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3174971098","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109480#issuecomment-3174971098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109480","id":3174971098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69Pjba","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T13:57:40Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T13:57:40Z","body":"While this is arguably better than not letting the user know at all, I suspect this change will instead lead to content creators seeing a warning every time they go to change the font on something like a `RichTextLabel`, because they will likely always check the override checkbox before going to select the font. This strikes me as a somewhat unfortunate user experience, and I would be surprised if not more people start complaining if/when we merge this, given that the theme override is the de facto way you typically change fonts for something like `RichTextLabel`.\r\n\r\nThe messages themselves could probably be phrased in some better way as well. I don't think people will necessarily know/understand that manually checking the override checkbox for resource-backed properties ends up duplicating the entire resource, so a warning message mentioning some attempt to copy an embedded resource and asking them to save it somewhere else, when all you did was check the override checkbox, might not get through.\r\n\r\nI can't help but feel like the better short-term change is to disallow the manual checking of the override checkbox for resource-backed properties altogether. If somebody absolutely wants a copy of the resource embedded/sub-resourced then they could presumably use Make Unique on the default/fallback resource. That would however mean that there's a somewhat weird discrepancy between non-resource properties and resource-backed properties, but that still feels like the \"lesser evil\" here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3174971098/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175509667","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109480#issuecomment-3175509667","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109480","id":3175509667,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69Rm6j","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T15:53:27Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T15:53:27Z","body":"Perhaps in the future we can consider applying different hints (icons or colors) to these categories in `EditorResourcePicker` instead of using `resource_path` for judgment.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175509667/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3178708301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109480#issuecomment-3178708301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109480","id":3178708301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69dz1N","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T10:16:45Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T10:16:45Z","body":"These latest changes do seem a lot better, to me at least.\r\n\r\nThe fact that resource properties now behave differently from non-resource properties does (as mentioned already) seem a bit weird, but seeing as how this was largely the behavior of the theme override properties pre-4.5 then I assume it shouldn't be too jarring for people already familiar with them at least.\r\n\r\n(You might want to edit the PR description to reflect these changes.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3178708301/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179224852","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109480#issuecomment-3179224852","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109480","id":3179224852,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69fx8U","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T12:56:38Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T12:56:38Z","body":"It would be nice if pressing the checkbox did not register undo action and mark the scene as modified. It's confusing if you click the button (with click feedback), but nothing really happens. Maybe a toast warning could show at least.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179224852/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179673881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109480#issuecomment-3179673881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109480","id":3179673881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69hfkZ","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T14:47:23Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T14:47:23Z","body":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb9ebe91-aaae-487a-8279-75b8e4409b17\r\n\r\nAlready modified as suggested.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179673881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3186205374","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109480#issuecomment-3186205374","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109480","id":3186205374,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc696aK-","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-13T23:45:11Z","updated_at":"2025-08-13T23:45:11Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3186205374/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]